    id="interactive-video-section"
    class="hidden md:flex w-screen h-screen items-center justify-center overflow-hidden relative mt-[-30%]"
  >
    <video
      id="interactive-video"
      class="w-full h-full object-cover"
      muted
      playsinline
      preload="auto"
    >
      <source src="/index/th2.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
    </video>

    <!-- Text Container (appears on left hover) -->
    <div
      id="left-info-container"
      class="absolute right-[20%] top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 max-w-md opacity-0 pointer-events-none transition-opacity duration-500"
    >
      <div
        class="backdrop-blur-md bg-slate-50/50 border border-slate-200 rounded-lg p-8"
      >
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-heading font-bold mb-4 text-slate-900">
          Assembly Challenges
        </h3>

        <p class="text-sm text-slate-900 leading-relaxed">
          The exposed fasteners became a critical design decision. Using minimal bolts to hold the structure together creates a striking, honest aesthetic while serving a clear purpose. Finding the balance between simple functionality and visual impact required careful placement and material selection.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Text Container (appears on center hover) -->
    <div
      id="center-info-container"
      class="absolute left-[20%] top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 max-w-md opacity-0 pointer-events-none transition-opacity duration-500"
    >
      <div
        class="backdrop-blur-md bg-slate-50/50 border border-slate-200 rounded-lg p-8"
      >
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-heading font-bold mb-4 text-slate-900">
          The Connection
        </h3>

        <p class="text-sm text-slate-900 leading-relaxed">
          The structure rests on curved steel legs, drilled to align with the screw path. A nut secures everything from below, creating a strong connection that emphasizes the robust, structural character.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Text Container (appears on right hover) -->
    <div
      id="right-info-container"
      class="absolute left-[20%] top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 max-w-md opacity-0 pointer-events-none transition-opacity duration-500"
    >
      <div
        class="backdrop-blur-md bg-slate-50/50 border border-slate-200 rounded-lg p-8"
      >
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-heading font-bold mb-4 text-slate-900">
          The Assembly
        </h3>

        <p class="text-sm text-slate-900 leading-relaxed">
          Bolts go through the plywood structure and the steel bar below. The fabric is pulled tight and stapled directly into the plywood core. This keeps the upholstery secure while the bolts hold the main structure together.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Interactive Area Overlay (300px height) -->
    <div
      id="interactive-area"
      class="absolute w-full flex justify-center items-center pointer-events-auto"
      style="height: 300px;"
    >
      <div
        class="w-full h-full flex"
        style="padding-left: 20%; padding-right: 20%;"
      >
        <div data-zone="left" class="flex-1 h-full cursor-pointer"></div>
        <div data-zone="center" class="flex-1 h-full cursor-pointer"></div>
        <div data-zone="right" class="flex-1 h-full cursor-pointer"></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Hover Instruction Overlay -->
    <div
