          I pushed this project further for my portfolio, exploring interactive design to make it come alive. Using GSAP and ScrollTrigger, I created smooth on-scroll animations that let the viewer scrub through the video based on mouse position across different zones. The result is an engaging, dynamic way to experience the furniture design and see every detail of how it was assembled.
